### 6.2 Normal Operation

#### 6.2.1 File Processing Workflow
1. **Detection**: File appears in INPUT_FOLDER
2. **Validation**: File extension matches FILE_PATTERNS
3. **Reading**: File opened in read-only mode
4. **Extraction**: Data extracted per configuration
5. **Writing**: Output files created in OUTPUT_FOLDER
6. **Post-Processing**: Input file moved/deleted/retained
7. **Logging**: All operations recorded

